# Share give page (hard rule)

Follow the design spec in `.cursor/rules/share-give-page-design.txt` when changing the donation-page share UI.

## Entry (switch)

- Add/keep a **Share page** option on the donation page action switch (sliding white thumb; see `segmented-switch.mdc`).
- Render `DonationPageShareCard` **only** when Share page is the active selection.
- Do not leave the share card always mounted on the settings form.

## Card structure

Match `share-give-page-design.txt`:

1. Header (Share2 + title + subtitle)
2. Campaign tag (UTM) field + helper
3. Live URL + **icon-only** copy control (Copied + green check after click)
4. Sliding switch: **Email link** | **Open live page**
5. Nested QR / embed panels; QR uses sliding switch **Download PNG** | **Copy image**; embed uses icon-only copy

## Copy controls

- Copy link and Copy embed: icon-only at rest (no `btn-primary`, no label)
- After success: temporary green `Check` + “Copied”, then revert

## Email dialog

- Compose actions use a sliding switch: **Save draft** | **Send** | **Open in device mail instead**
- Load mailbox signature into compose; append HTML (with images) on send/draft

## Publish gate

- Copy / email / QR / embed require a published give page
- Unpublished: show a clear publish-first notice; disable share actions

